IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `ppl-logic`
IMPORT `ppl-time`
IMPORT `ppl-key-provisions`

-- Every expected value is written from the section named beside it.

§ `s 11A -- payable if a determination is in force`

#ASSERT `parental leave pay is payable to a person for a flexible PPL day` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `parental leave pay is payable to a person for a flexible PPL day` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `s 11B -- the Secretary cannot determine unless the person was or will be eligible`

#ASSERT `the Secretary can make a determination under section 13 or 14 for a flexible PPL day, as section 11B bears on it` (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- eligible: the bar does not apply, and the section does not say the Secretary can
#ASSERT `the Secretary can make a determination under section 13 or 14 for a flexible PPL day, as section 11B bears on it` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `the Secretary can make a determination under section 13 or 14 for a flexible PPL day, as section 11B bears on it` NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING

§ `s 11C -- the Secretary cannot determine unless the person has claimed`

#ASSERT `the Secretary can make a determination under section 13 or 14 for a flexible PPL day, as section 11C bears on it` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `the Secretary can make a determination under section 13 or 14 for a flexible PPL day, as section 11C bears on it` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `the Secretary can make a determination under section 13 or 14 for a flexible PPL day, as section 11C bears on it` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `the Secretary can make a determination under section 13 or 14 for a flexible PPL day, as section 11C bears on it` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
